WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.552
With Locize, new keys go to Locize,

2
00:00:03.552 --> 00:00:06.267
and your app loads
translations from its CDN.

3
00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:08.461
It adds AI translation,

4
00:00:08.461 --> 00:00:11.120
versions, and in-context editing,

5
00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:12.768
and engineers keep the keys.

6
00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:17.190
General Translation can be
your i18n library and translate

7
00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:19.744
it, or your i18next files.

8
00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:25.086
Keep i18next, point the
CLI at its JSON files,

9
00:00:25.086 --> 00:00:28.173
and run npx gt translate.

10
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:30.960
Or move a feature
into a T component,

11
00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:32.306
with no keys to name.

12
00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:36.377
Each run translates only
new or changed content.

13
00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:39.773
Your team now ships
Spanish with each release.
